<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Health raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Health raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs upgraded American Health Properties Inc to market outperform from market perform, a Goldman source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 at 25-1/8.</p>
</text>
